WEBVTT

00:03.790 --> 00:07.250
I have this idea for a book.

00:07.500 --> 00:17.500
<b>Name</b>

00:07.580 --> 00:10.630
It's about this ordinary guy who gets
transported to an alternate world.

00:10.630 --> 00:12.880
Cursed by powerful black magic,

00:12.880 --> 00:16.710
he is doomed to take the
life of anything he touches.

00:16.710 --> 00:18.420
It's true dark fantasy.

00:19.040 --> 00:22.460
It'll have such gruesome stuff in it that
it might even get pulled from the presses.

00:23.670 --> 00:25.880
This is my design for the heroine.

00:26.130 --> 00:30.080
She's not really based on anyone in particular, I swear.

02:11.000 --> 02:15.420
<b>Nurse's Office</b>

02:11.790 --> 02:14.460
Something in my skull is driving me mad.

02:16.380 --> 02:18.250
You don't seem to have a fever.

02:18.460 --> 02:20.460
Want to stay and rest for an hour?

02:20.460 --> 02:22.040
S-sure...

02:22.420 --> 02:28.330
<b>ICHIKAWA</b>

02:22.580 --> 02:25.130
If only I could be more care-free,

02:25.130 --> 02:27.630
I could keep my mind for myself.

02:28.380 --> 02:29.330
<b>YAMADA</b>

02:29.380 --> 02:31.580
<b>YAMADA</b>

02:29.790 --> 02:31.500
What? Yamada?!

02:31.630 --> 02:36.080
<b>ICHIKAWA</b>

02:31.710 --> 02:33.960
Wait, r-r-relax...

02:33.960 --> 02:36.040
There's someone with the same last name in Class 1.

02:38.710 --> 02:41.830
The hotter my body gets, the more my head aches...

02:42.710 --> 02:43.170
Let me know if you feel sick again.

02:43.170 --> 02:44.210
Let me know if you feel sick again.
Come on, no need to even think about it.<b></b>

02:44.210 --> 02:45.080
Come on, no need to even think about it.

02:45.080 --> 02:47.290
Just assume it's Yamada from Class 1.

02:47.290 --> 02:48.040
I just need some rest-

02:48.040 --> 02:50.210
Okay, let's get Ichikawa marked down here...
I just need some rest-<b></b>

02:50.210 --> 02:51.000
Okay, let's get Ichikawa marked down here...

02:57.750 --> 03:00.290
It IS her!

03:00.750 --> 03:04.750
Now that I think of it,
she wasn't in class after our gym marathon-

03:04.750 --> 03:05.790
Wait!

03:06.130 --> 03:09.290
Is this it?
Is this my chance to murder her?!

03:11.580 --> 03:14.170
Her skin is white as a corpse.

03:14.170 --> 03:16.250
As smooth as a sculpture...

03:16.250 --> 03:18.130
...but somehow soft, too.

03:23.080 --> 03:24.460
Thank goodness.

03:24.460 --> 03:25.420
Huh?

03:25.880 --> 03:28.790
I thought some stranger was staring at me.

03:28.790 --> 03:30.960
Glad it was only someone I know.

03:31.170 --> 03:32.790
Like that makes it better!

03:33.670 --> 03:35.130
What's wrong?

03:35.380 --> 03:36.670
Inside my skull there's this...

03:36.670 --> 03:39.000
Uh, I mean, I have a headache.

03:39.580 --> 03:41.290
Y-you?

03:42.960 --> 03:44.750
My stomach hurts...

03:44.750 --> 03:45.790
Oh...

03:46.170 --> 03:47.830
Bet she ate something bad.

04:01.130 --> 04:05.210
Here... This stuff works on headaches, too.

04:06.080 --> 04:07.790
Y-you don't mind?

04:08.170 --> 04:10.580
Hurry up and take it!

04:10.580 --> 04:12.290
Right, thanks...

04:13.500 --> 04:17.000
She handed this over faster than she ever would a snack.

04:18.330 --> 04:19.540
It's wet?

04:20.040 --> 04:21.830
Yamada took this, too?

04:22.500 --> 04:24.040
Then that means...

04:25.170 --> 04:27.250
W-well, not like I have much choice!

04:27.250 --> 04:29.080
Can't just not take my medicine.

04:47.210 --> 04:48.500
I need to head back.

04:54.250 --> 04:56.330
Dammit all!

04:57.000 --> 04:59.250
No crossing the line unless absolutely necessary.

04:59.540 --> 05:01.580
That's my policy.

05:03.130 --> 05:05.880
<b>YAMADA</b>

05:03.750 --> 05:05.540
She forgot her shirt.

05:12.540 --> 05:14.500
Whoa now! What am I doing?

05:14.500 --> 05:16.380
This is DEFINITELY not necessary.

05:16.380 --> 05:18.670
Stop! Don't!

05:19.420 --> 05:22.170
M-my hand, it has a mind of its own!

05:22.630 --> 05:26.000
This must be that creature inside my skull!

05:26.000 --> 05:28.250
It's some sort of mind controlling parasite!

05:28.250 --> 05:31.750
G-give me my left hand back!

05:38.290 --> 05:39.920
What's with all this candy?

05:39.920 --> 05:41.830
Ack, she forgot her shirt, too.

05:42.420 --> 05:44.670
You're in Class 2-3, right?

05:44.960 --> 05:45.710
Yes.

05:46.000 --> 05:47.790
Take this back with you later, okay?

05:49.250 --> 05:51.080
Are you kidding me?

05:51.920 --> 05:53.960
Nothing I can do about it now!

05:53.960 --> 05:55.630
This is entirely against my will!

05:55.630 --> 05:58.880
I-I-I've been forced...

06:02.130 --> 06:05.250
Well well, fancy that.

06:05.250 --> 06:08.920
It's got this mellow, bittersweet fragrance...

06:09.330 --> 06:10.670
It's actually kinda like...

06:10.670 --> 06:12.670
It just smells like sweat!

06:12.960 --> 06:19.210
Aren't girls supposed to have a more like, y'know,
floral, soapy, almost shampoo kind of smell?

06:19.210 --> 06:21.380
Not that it matters...

06:22.080 --> 06:26.290
But the creature in my skull
seems to be migrating to my lower body.

06:26.500 --> 06:28.670
That took longer than it should have.

06:32.880 --> 06:40.170
I'll have to return to my holy grounds during
lunch and work on my book some more.

06:41.330 --> 06:43.500
I forgot it in the nurse's office!

06:43.500 --> 06:44.130
Huh?

06:44.250 --> 06:45.420
Oh, here...

06:47.130 --> 06:48.380
Forgot what?

06:47.540 --> 06:48.420
<b>KOBAYASHI</b>

06:49.670 --> 06:50.830
My candy!

06:51.630 --> 06:52.630
THAT'S all you care about?

06:52.630 --> 06:54.080
Guess she's feeling better.

06:56.420 --> 06:58.420
Hey, did you change shampoos?

06:58.420 --> 06:59.920
Hey, did you change shampoos?
Now his left arm...<b></b>

06:59.920 --> 07:04.920
Ooh, what if he wipes out an entire
city after his left arm goes haywire?

07:07.460 --> 07:11.170
Let's go play a little game where
we ask the girls if they touch themselves!

07:11.380 --> 07:14.250
What kind of disgusting, sleazebag game is that?!

07:14.500 --> 07:16.170
Does the winner have to ask?

07:16.170 --> 07:16.580
Shouldn't the loser?

07:16.580 --> 07:17.830
How pervy is this guy?!
Shouldn't the loser?<b></b>

07:17.830 --> 07:19.040
How pervy is this guy?!
C'mon, let's do this.<b></b>

07:19.040 --> 07:20.830
Ready? Call the fingers-2!

07:21.250 --> 07:23.290
