07:23.290 --> 07:24.330
Of course, it's me...

07:24.330 --> 07:25.580
Go get 'em!

07:26.420 --> 07:27.250
Don't do it!

07:27.380 --> 07:28.630
Hey, uhh...

07:37.330 --> 07:41.880
I uhh, can tell how healthy you
are from your nails, y'know.

07:41.880 --> 07:43.540
How "healthy" we are?

07:43.960 --> 07:46.290
Would ya look at that.

07:46.630 --> 07:49.080
You're all nice and healthy.

07:50.920 --> 07:52.170
Later, then!

07:52.630 --> 07:53.880
Well?

07:53.880 --> 07:56.130
They all keep their nails super short,
so they definitely do it!

07:57.000 --> 07:57.960
You're a genius!

07:57.960 --> 07:58.790
You guys are so lame.
You're a genius!<b></b>

07:58.790 --> 08:01.130
They might actually be into toys, though!

08:01.130 --> 08:01.830
I've heard about enough out of you!

08:01.830 --> 08:03.170
I've heard about enough out of you!
Ooh, good point!<b></b>

08:03.170 --> 08:04.130
At least the whole situation is over and done with.
Ooh, good point!<b></b>

08:04.130 --> 08:06.250
At least the whole situation is over and done with.
Gonna go talk to Ichikawa real quick.<b></b>

08:06.420 --> 08:08.170
Heya, Ichikawa!

08:08.880 --> 08:11.880
Do me a favor and pass this to Yamada, yeah?

08:14.830 --> 08:17.460
T-this is cruel!

08:17.460 --> 08:19.460
Bullying, plain and simple!

08:20.080 --> 08:24.960
