"Do you masturbate?" inside!

08:28.830 --> 08:32.460
I kinda want to be a nail stylist.

08:33.960 --> 08:35.710
H-here!

08:50.210 --> 08:51.960
Glad I managed to swap these out...

08:55.920 --> 08:59.380
<b>Gimme your LINE address</b>

08:55.920 --> 08:59.380
<b>from Adachi</b>

08:56.750 --> 08:58.830
It wasn't even dirty?!

09:00.210 --> 09:03.920
Gah! Now I have to redraw that character!

09:03.920 --> 09:05.830
What a waste of time!

09:05.960 --> 09:10.670
This personality test shows what
someone's favorite sex position is!

09:10.670 --> 09:12.880
N-no way!

09:12.960 --> 09:13.750
Here they go again.

09:13.750 --> 09:17.960
How can they even shout out "sex position"
in the middle of the classroom like that?

09:17.960 --> 09:20.670
Why do kids always want to
use words they've just learned?!

09:20.670 --> 09:21.460
Go on, then!

09:21.670 --> 09:24.500
Hey girlies, let's do a personality test together!

09:24.500 --> 09:25.670
Don't do it!

09:25.830 --> 09:26.750
What now?

09:26.750 --> 09:29.080
I love tests like that!

09:29.080 --> 09:31.330
Right? C'mon, then!

09:32.420 --> 09:35.420
How dare you use their obsessions
for your twisted games!

09:35.790 --> 09:39.460
I wonder how Yamada will react to dirty jokes, though...

09:40.040 --> 09:41.040
<b>Laughter</b>

09:41.040 --> 09:42.040
<b>Laughter</b>

09:41.040 --> 09:42.040
<b>Anger</b>

09:42.040 --> 09:43.040
<b>Laughter                                                Oblivious</b>

09:42.040 --> 09:43.040
<b>Anger</b>

09:43.040 --> 09:43.920
<b>Laughter                                                Oblivious</b>

09:43.040 --> 09:43.920
<b>Anger                                                          Blush</b>

09:44.000 --> 09:46.130
T-they all seem likely!

09:46.500 --> 09:47.880
Let's get started, then.

09:47.880 --> 09:50.380
Grab onto my fist with one hand.

09:50.380 --> 09:52.040
Wait, that's all?

09:52.040 --> 09:54.130
C'mon, do whatever comes to mind!

09:54.290 --> 09:57.170
The way they touch it shows
how assertive they are in bed!

09:57.170 --> 09:58.330
Seriously?

09:59.000 --> 10:01.750
Some want to keep things even and prefer missionary.

10:01.750 --> 10:02.540
Makes sense.

10:02.540 --> 10:04.330
Others want to be controlled and like it from behind.

10:04.330 --> 10:05.130
Really?

10:05.130 --> 10:07.380
And some want to be in control, and ride on top.

10:07.380 --> 10:08.080
No way!

10:08.080 --> 10:09.380
And then there's the real kinky ones!

10:09.380 --> 10:10.500
Wow!

10:10.540 --> 10:12.960
T-that's ridiculous!

10:13.170 --> 10:15.830
Oh, I see what's going on.

10:16.080 --> 10:18.790
You just wanna touch our hands, don't you?

10:18.790 --> 10:20.330
N-no I don't!

10:20.330 --> 10:21.920
Bet that's actually part of it.

10:22.170 --> 10:24.290
Why are you only asking us, then?

10:24.960 --> 10:26.460
She's got her wits about her.

10:26.460 --> 10:31.500
R-right. Sure. Come join us, guys...

10:32.250 --> 10:33.920
They're seriously going to?

10:34.330 --> 10:37.290
Okay, somebody touch my hand...

10:40.080 --> 10:41.130
Here...

10:43.500 --> 10:45.250
Don't you "here" me!

10:46.080 --> 10:49.880
A touch from below means he wants to
be controlled and likes it from behind.

10:49.880 --> 10:51.210
I can't get it out of my head!

10:51.380 --> 10:52.830
Someone hurry up and go next!

10:53.920 --> 10:55.130
You're supposed to use your hand!

10:55.330 --> 10:56.540
She's into toys!

10:58.380 --> 11:00.420
Do you not know what hands are?!

11:00.420 --> 11:01.750
She's into footjobs!

11:02.540 --> 11:03.210
Here, then.

11:03.540 --> 11:05.500
Use your OWN hand!

11:05.630 --> 11:07.040
She's into threesomes!

11:07.330 --> 11:09.750
Life must be fun as an idiot...

11:10.000 --> 11:11.830
What about you, Yamada?!

11:11.830 --> 11:13.040
Wait, I'm up last?

11:19.710 --> 11:21.960
This isn't supposed to be a joke contest, you know.

11:22.290 --> 11:25.380
Eww, I found the one they're doing.

11:25.630 --> 11:27.210
It's some pervy one.

11:27.210 --> 11:29.170
Wow, sure is.

11:32.540 --> 11:34.420
Jeez!

11:36.210 --> 11:38.420
