11:38.630 --> 11:42.130
What can some pervy personality
test even tell you, anyway?

11:42.830 --> 11:46.460
I bet some creep who loves mixer
parties made the whole thing up.

11:48.040 --> 11:49.330
She off to the bathroom?

11:55.250 --> 11:57.710
<b>Tastes Just Like Mom's</b>

11:57.830 --> 12:00.960
One, two, three, four...

12:12.540 --> 12:13.580
Sorry...

12:14.540 --> 12:18.420
A touch from above means she wants to
control her partner and likes to ride on top!

12:21.500 --> 12:23.540
She wants to control her partner...

12:24.830 --> 12:26.380
And likes to ride on top?!

12:28.750 --> 12:31.040
Oh, it was in my pocket!

12:32.000 --> 12:36.500
Things sure "took off" after that...

12:38.960 --> 12:40.880
All right, listen up.

12:41.290 --> 12:43.710
Today we start learning to play basketball.

12:43.710 --> 12:47.420
You'll all break up into teams of 5 to practice.

12:47.750 --> 12:52.210
<b>YAMADA</b>

12:47.790 --> 12:48.920
Tickle tickle tickle!

12:48.920 --> 12:50.210
Cut it out!

12:50.580 --> 12:52.040
Hey, Yamada!

12:52.290 --> 12:53.830
Quit wiggling around.

12:53.830 --> 12:54.330
Yessir.

12:54.330 --> 12:57.290
What are you, an elementary school boy?

12:57.460 --> 12:58.170
Are we on the same team?

12:58.170 --> 12:59.420
Are we on the same team?
You take defense under the net.<b></b>

12:59.420 --> 13:00.880
You take defense under the net.

13:00.960 --> 13:01.750
Why?

13:01.750 --> 13:06.040
I have a photoshoot tomorrow,
so I wanna work off some fat!

13:06.040 --> 13:07.790
You're just gonna get in the way.

13:07.790 --> 13:11.210
You can run off all the fat you want later.

13:11.420 --> 13:13.460
I'm in the basketball club too, you know!

13:13.460 --> 13:15.040
And you never show up!

13:15.130 --> 13:17.670
It's not like you have any fat to burn off, anyway.

13:17.670 --> 13:22.880
Swept up in such peaceful moments,
I sometimes lose track of what I'm even doing.

13:23.540 --> 13:27.750
That's not true! You should see the other models.

13:28.290 --> 13:31.040
I, more or less, know what I need to about Yamada.

13:31.380 --> 13:33.210
And I know how open she leaves herself.

13:33.500 --> 13:36.750
All that's left is to put my murderous intent into action.

13:36.750 --> 13:38.040
But...

13:45.580 --> 13:46.670
Sorry!

13:57.790 --> 13:58.670
Thanks!

14:00.000 --> 14:05.210
<b>ICHIKAWA</b>

14:01.290 --> 14:03.460
What's this strange feeling I have, now?

14:03.460 --> 14:07.130
What keeps my thoughts and actions from lining up?

14:09.420 --> 14:11.880
One or the other has to be wrong.

14:12.710 --> 14:14.710
I'm pretty sure it's my actions.

14:20.750 --> 14:21.670
Huh?

14:23.750 --> 14:24.630
Yamada!

14:28.080 --> 14:29.130
Are you okay?!

14:32.790 --> 14:33.330
Hup!

14:33.330 --> 14:34.920
Don't "hup" me!

14:36.500 --> 14:37.960
What the heck...

14:38.670 --> 14:41.290
She was looking at me though, right?

14:41.420 --> 14:42.790
Mr. Maeda!

14:43.080 --> 14:45.040
Tissues. Anyone got tissues?

14:45.330 --> 14:46.920
Pinch it hard.

14:47.630 --> 14:48.630
Do it right.

14:51.420 --> 14:52.880
You good to walk?

14:53.920 --> 14:56.460
I want the rest of you to stretch out.

14:56.830 --> 14:58.210
Let's go see the nurse.

14:58.210 --> 14:59.290
I'll go with her.

14:59.670 --> 15:00.830
Who made that pass?

15:01.420 --> 15:04.960
But it wasn't on purpose...

15:05.880 --> 15:07.670
Then what are you laughing about?!

15:08.330 --> 15:10.040
Easy, now...

15:12.460 --> 15:13.750
Here it goes again...

15:18.540 --> 15:20.040
Here I go...

15:20.710 --> 15:23.000
Doing the wrong thing!

15:24.670 --> 15:27.380
<b>Nurse's Office</b>

15:27.460 --> 15:29.460
I'm fine already.

15:29.460 --> 15:30.330
But...

15:30.790 --> 15:32.460
This is embarrassing.

15:32.830 --> 15:37.710
Kobayashi, head back and get
Yamada's uniform and bag.

15:38.000 --> 15:38.630
Okay.

15:38.630 --> 15:39.670
Shoot!

15:39.750 --> 15:41.630
Is your phone in your bag?

15:41.710 --> 15:42.630
Yeah...

15:42.960 --> 15:44.500
I'll go call her family.

15:45.080 --> 15:46.380
Thank you.

15:46.790 --> 15:48.290
<b>KOBAYASHI</b>

15:51.670 --> 15:53.880
What the heck am I doing?!

15:54.210 --> 15:57.210
There's no point in following her like this!

15:58.330 --> 16:00.040
That's a lot of blood.

16:00.420 --> 16:02.380
Okay, I'll put her on, now.

16:02.540 --> 16:05.420
Your mom is going to come pick you up.

16:09.210 --> 16:10.170
Mama?

16:10.880 --> 16:12.750
Yeah, I'm fine.

16:14.080 --> 16:15.580
But tomorrow...

16:16.710 --> 16:17.750
Tomorrow...

16:19.170 --> 16:23.540
I have a photoshoot tomorrow,
so I wanna work off some fat!

16:24.960 --> 16:26.000
I'm sorry...

16:26.330 --> 16:27.630
I'm really sorry...

16:31.210 --> 16:33.250
So, so sorry...

16:44.080 --> 16:47.210
Hang on, what am I crying for?

17:22.920 --> 17:25.330
<b>YAMADA</b>

17:27.630 --> 17:30.080
<b>I</b>

17:28.380 --> 17:29.670
I...

17:33.130 --> 17:35.080
I like her...

17:37.630 --> 17:40.080
<b>Year 2 Class 3</b>

17:43.170 --> 17:45.630
<b>YOSHIDA</b>

17:51.380 --> 17:52.420
Guys, look!

17:52.420 --> 17:53.330
What is it?

17:53.330 --> 17:55.420
I've got one of Yamada's bloody tissues!

17:55.710 --> 17:57.210
Throw that away!

17:57.380 --> 18:00.460
You creeps! Enough is enough-

18:03.830 --> 18:05.380
Musta been on the way out...

18:11.540 --> 18:15.790
The next day, Yamada showed up at school,
same as always.

18:18.750 --> 18:20.500
What happened to your nose?

18:20.500 --> 18:22.630
It happened during basketball yesterday...

18:22.830 --> 18:24.790
Something happen to your nose?

18:25.130 --> 18:27.630
I just got hit with a basketball.

18:29.250 --> 18:32.710
Oh. Basketball-BAM!

18:37.960 --> 18:40.880
<b>I got hit with a basketball.</b>

18:38.380 --> 18:39.210
Perfect.

18:39.210 --> 18:40.710
Hardly!

18:40.960 --> 18:44.130
