18:44.130 --> 18:46.080
Really had me stressed out.

18:46.750 --> 18:48.040
Sorry, girls.

18:48.040 --> 18:49.580
You all right?

18:50.000 --> 18:50.920
Yeah...

18:51.290 --> 18:52.880
But I was pretty worried.

18:53.500 --> 18:59.500
I don't know what I'd do if it was
broken and crooked for good...

19:00.330 --> 19:03.080
I was so scared!

19:05.130 --> 19:07.210
Yeah, yeah...

19:07.670 --> 19:10.420
You had a photoshoot today too, right?

19:10.750 --> 19:12.420
These things happen, though.

19:15.170 --> 19:18.880
My mom and my manager Suwa said the same thing...

19:18.880 --> 19:21.170
But I'm sure they're both disappointed.

19:21.880 --> 19:27.420
They said this stuff happens in junior high,
and that kids get hurt all the time.

19:28.080 --> 19:33.460
But that's the part about this that hurts most.

19:35.460 --> 19:41.920
Yamada really is a bit more grown up than the rest of us.

19:46.130 --> 19:48.130
Doesn't it look like they're doing it?

19:48.130 --> 19:49.670
Shut your face!

20:18.790 --> 20:21.710
Just kinda looks like someone forgot it on accident, huh?

20:27.170 --> 20:31.670
<b>Feel free to use</b>

20:27.460 --> 20:29.790
Ugh, now it just looks like a trap.

20:29.790 --> 20:31.330
And forced, too.

20:31.960 --> 20:35.130
Wait, I still have plenty more.

20:49.330 --> 20:51.460
Yup! Way less suspicious this way!

20:51.460 --> 20:55.130
Just like when they leave tissues
